      "message": "\u003e `usage3` of `VkNativeAndroidBufferAndroid` now passes in the `ahb-\u003eResourceId()`\n\nThis is not a good solution because now tests (`GfxstreamEnd2EndVkTests.cpp`) have to do something that a normal guest would not do and testers have to know about this extra testing backdoor.\n\nCan you move just `RutabagaLayer.cpp` out into a separate shared library (`libgfxstream_platform_rutabaga_vmm` or `libgfxstream_platform_rutabaga_kernel` etc) since this kernel/vmm emulation layer should be a single instance across all guest libs in the same way `libgfxstream_backend` is.",
